      "name": "arenson9",
      "username": "arenson9",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-29T04:43:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think that Iron Legacy will prove harder than The Chairman or The Matriarch in the sense that there will be fewer winable games. If you don't get the right cards out early, you can very quickly fall so far behind that there's just no coming back.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
