      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-29T05:40:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I daresay the Matriarch has a lot of \"right cards\" associated with her as well. &nbsp;But Iron Legacy is no slouch - probably harder, but they both have weaknesses.</p><p>To the OP, my interpretation is something like</p><p>Kismet - 2, maybe a 1.</p><p>Capitan - 2-3.</p><p>Miss Information - 2-3.</p><p>Dreamer - 3.</p><p>Iron Legacy 4.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
