      "raw": "<p>I daresay the Matriarch has a lot of &quot;right cards&quot; associated with her as well. &nbsp;But Iron Legacy is no slouch - probably harder, but they both have weaknesses.</p><p>To the OP, my interpretation is something like</p><p>Kismet - 2, maybe a 1.</p><p>Capitan - 2-3.</p><p>Miss Information - 2-3.</p><p>Dreamer - 3.</p><p>Iron Legacy 4.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
